.TH XANARA 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xanara \- Xanara document viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xanara
[OPTIONS] FILES...
.SH DESCRIPTION
View PDF, PostScript, DjVu and comic documents with the native Xanara GTK viewer.
.PP
This is an independent native executable built from the SDE fork sources
and included in the sde package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display the native application options.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Original upstream copyrights and licenses are preserved. Settings at the SDE
Suite page provides the source link and full installed notice.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-settings (1),
.BR sde-suite (1)
